WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.835
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Word: Format Your Text.

2
00:00:06.135 --> 00:00:10.784
Make your document clear and attractive. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:17.051
Step one. Select the words you want to change. Click at the start and drag to the end.

4
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.689
Step two. Click B to make the words bold. Change the font size to make the title bigger.

5
00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:28.566
Step three. Click Center to put the title in the middle of the page.

6
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:36.271
Step four. Click Font colour and choose a colour. Do not use too many colours. Keep your document easy to read.

7
00:00:37.283 --> 00:00:41.108
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:44.360
Make your title bold, size 24 and centred.

9
00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.170
Change one word to a different colour.

10
00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.957
Save your work with Ctrl+S.

11
00:00:50.257 --> 00:00:51.154
Well done!

